nero para competir en m\xe1s torneos con premios reales.","User Limit Reached. {0}/{1}":"L\xedmite de usuario alcanzado. {0}/{1}","Username Unavailable":"Nombre de usuario no disponible","Username must be between 2 and 26 characters":"El nombre de usuario debe tener entre 2 y 26 caracteres","Username must only contain letters, numbers, hyphens (-), underscores (_), or tildes (~)":"El nombre de usuario solo puede contener letras, n\xfameros, guiones (-), guiones bajos (_) o tildes (~)","Username or Email":"Nombre de usuario o correo electr\xf3nico","Users must be at least 18 years old to participate in Ticketz. By tapping 'Submit' I agree to the Terms of Service.":"Los usuarios deben tener por lo menos 18 a\xf1os de edad para participar en Ticketz. Al presionar \"Enviar\", acepto los T\xe9rminos de servicio.","VERIFY PHONE NUMBER":"VERIFICAR N\xdaMERO DE TEL\xc9FONO","VIEW LEAGUES":"VER LIGAS","VIEW NOW":"VER AHORA","VIEW TROPHIES":"VER TROFEOS",VS:"Contra","VS ALL":"CONTRA TODOS","VS EVERYONE":"CONTRA CADA UNO","VS Friends":"Contra amigos","VS YOU":"CONTRA TI","VS {0}":"CONTRA {0}","Verification Email Sent!":"\xa1Mensaje de verificaci\xf3n enviado!","Verification Required":"Verificaci\xf3n necesaria","Verification email successfully sent":"Mensaje de correo electr\xf3nico de comprobaci\xf3n enviado con \xe9xito","Verification needed to use for PayPal":"Es necesario realizar una verificaci\xf3n para PayPal",Verify:"Verificar","Verify Password":"Verificar contrase\xf1a","Verify your Skillz account to send chat messages.":"Verifica tu cuenta Skillz para enviar mensajes de chat.","Verify your password to add or verify a PayPal email":"Verifica tu contrase\xf1a para a\xf1adir o verifica un correo electr\xf3nico de PayPal","Verify your password to switch your primary email.":"Verifica tu contrase\xf1a para cambiar tu correo electr\xf3nico principal",Video:"","View All":"Ver todo","View Blocked":"Ver bloqueados","View Conversation":"Ver conversaci\xf3n","View Pending Requests":"Ver Solicitudes pendientes","View Skillz News":"Ver novedades de Skillz","Visit here to get more {0}":"Visite aqu\xed para obtener m\xe1s {0}",W:"W","WAITING FOR OPPONENT...":"ESPERANDO A UN RIVAL...","WAITING FOR RESULTS":"ESTAMOS ESPERANDO LOS RESULTADOS","WATCH NOW":"VER AHORA","WATCH REPLAY":"VER LA REPETICI\xd3N","WATCH VIDEO":"VER EL VIDEO","WELCOME BACK":"BIENVENIDO","WHO WILL BE THE CHAMPION?":"\xbfQUI\xc9N SER\xc1 EL CAMPE\xd3N?","WIN STREAK":"RACHA DE VICTORIAS",WINNER:"GANADOR","WINS/WIN STREAK":"VICTORIA/RACHA DE VICTORIAS","WITH A ":"RET A ",WITHDRAW:"REINTEGRO","Waiting for Opponent...":"Esperando a un rival...","Waiting for opponent to join":"Esperando a que se una el oponente","Waiting for other matches to finish":"Esperando que finalicen otras partidas","Want more challenges?":"\xbfQuieres m\xe1s desaf\xedos?","Wants a Rematch!":"\xa1Quiere la revancha!","Warning: Push Notifications Disabled":"Advertencia: Notificaciones Push desactivadas","Watch Ad":"Ver un anuncio","Watch Ad Entries":"Ver anuncio m\xe1s veces:","Watch an ad to double your {0} winnings":"Ve un anuncio para duplicar tus ganancias de {0}","Watch an ad to get {0}{1} back":"Ve un anuncio para recuperar {0}{1}","Watch an ad to recover {0}{1}":"Ve un anuncio para recuperar {0}{1}","We are matching you with an opponent of similar skill level.":"Estamos buscando a un oponente que tenga un nivel de habilidades similar al suyo.","We are searching for a new opponent of similar skill level.":"Estamos buscando un nuevo rival con nivel de habilidades similar.","We couldn't find any of your contacts on Skillz. Please try again soon!":"No pudimos encontrar ninguno de sus contactos en Skillz. \xa1Intente de nuevo pronto!","We need your location to determine eligibility for skill-based cash gaming in your region.":"Necesitamos tu ubicaci\xf3n para determinar si puedes jugar a juegos de habilidad con dinero en tu regi\xf3n.","We need your location to determine eligibility for this tournament.":"Necesitamos su ubicaci\xf3n para determinar su idoneidad para este torneo.","We were unable to load your ad. You will still be awarded your {0}.":"No pudimos cargar tu anuncio pero igualmente recibir\xe1s {0} como recompensa.",Welcome:"Bienvenido","Welcome Back":"\xa1Bienvenido!","Welcome back, claim today\u2019s reward!":"\xa1Te damos la bienvenida de nuevo! Reclama tu recompensa.","Welcome to Leagues":"Bienvenido a las ligas","Welcome to Skillz Chat":"Bienvenido al Chat de Skillz","Welcome to Ticketz!":"\xa1Bienvenido a Ticketz!","Welcome to the Event!":"\xa1Bienvenido al evento!","Welcome to {0}! Practice while you wait for your event to start":"\xa1Bienvenido a {0}! Practica mientras esperas que comience tu evento","Well fought! Tap PLAY AGAIN to find another live match.":"\xa1Buena lucha! Toca JUGAR DE NUEVO para encontrar otra partida en directo.","We\u2019re finding you an opponent and will alert you when a match is found.":"Te estamos buscando un oponente y te avisaremos cuando encontremos una partida.","We\u2019ve added your ":"Hemos a\xf1adido tu ","When they deposit {0}, **you\u2019ll both get another {1}!**":"\xa1Cuando depositen {0}, **ambos recibir\xe9is {1} m\xe1s**!","When they deposit {0}, **you\u2019ll get another {1}**, and **they\u2019ll get another {2}!**":"\xa1Cuando depositen {0}, **recibir\xe1s {1}* m\xe1s*, y **ellos recibir\xe1n {2} m\xe1s**!","When they use your promo code to make their first Skillz deposit, **you\u2019ll both get {0}!**":"\xa1Cuando utilicen tu c\xf3digo promocional para hacer su primer dep\xf3sito en Skillz, **ambos recibir\xe9is {0}**!","When they use your promo code to make their first Skillz deposit, **you\u2019ll get {0}**, and **they\u2019ll get {1}!**":"Cuando utilicen tu c\xf3digo promocional para hacer su primer dep\xf3sito en Skillz, **recibir\xe1s {0}** y **ellos recibir\xe1n {1}**.","Win matches to level up faster!":"\xa1Gana partidas para subir m\xe1s r\xe1pido de nivel!","Win medals to climb the ranks!":"\xa1Gana medallas para ascender en la clasificaci\xf3n!","Win or lose you earn Ticketz for every match. Save up your ticketz to redeem amazing prizes!":"Ganes o pierdas, ganar\xe1s Ticketz por cada partida. \xa1Ahorra tus Ticketz para canjear premios incre\xedbles!","Win or lose, you earn Ticketz after every match. Your tier increases as you earn more Ticketz.":"Ganes o pierdas, ganar\xe1s Ticketz despu\xe9s de cada partida. Tu nivel aumenta a medida que ganas m\xe1s Ticketz.","Win or lose, you'll earn them with each match you play.":"Ganes o pierdas, los obtendr\xe1s con cada partida que juegues.",Winner:"Ganador","Winnings were applied to your balance at the time of match conclusion.":"Las ganancias se aplicaron a tu saldo en el momento de la finalizaci\xf3n de la partida.",Withdraw:"Reintegro","Withdraw Pending":"Retiro pendiente","Withdraw {0}?":"\xbfRealizar un reintegro de {0}?","Withdrawal Amount":"Cantidad del reintegro","Withdrawal Details":"Informaci\xf3n del reintegro","Withdrawal Method":"M\xe9todo del reintegro","Withdrawals under {0} are subject to a {1} processing fee.":"Los reintegros inferiores a {0} est\xe1n sujetos a una cuota de tramitaci\xf3n de {1}.","Withdrawals will be refunded via the original method when possible.":"Siempre que sea posible, los reintegros se realizar\xe1n utilizando el m\xe9todo inicial.","Would You Like to Update Your Username?":"\xbfQuieres actualizar tu nombre de usuario?","Would you like Skillz to send {0} an invite via SMS on your behalf?":"\xbfQuieres que Skillz env\xede a {0} una invitaci\xf3n a trav\xe9s de SMS en tu nombre?","Would you like to view this page in your web browser?":"\xbfQuieres ver esta p\xe1gina en tu navegador web?","Would you like us to notify you when {0} Event goes live?":"\xbfQuisiera que le notifiquemos cuando inicie el Evento {0}?",YES:"S\xcd","YOU LOST":"HAS PERDIDO","YOU PLACED":"HAS QUEDADO","YOU PLACED {0}":"HAS QUEDADO {0}","YOU TIED":"HAS EMPATADO","YOU VS":"T\xda CONTRA","YOU VS EVERYONE":"T\xda CONTRA CADA UNO","YOU WON":"HAS GANADO","YOU WON!":"\xa1HAS GANADO!","YOU'RE ABOUT TO PLAY A LIVE MATCH":"EST\xc1 A PUNTO DE JUGAR UNA PARTIDA EN VIVO","YOUR CONNECTION STRENGTH HAS DROPPED":"LA INTENSIDAD DE LA CONEXI\xd3N BAJ\xd3","YOUR LEVELS":"TUS NIVELES","YOUR SCORE":"SU PUNTUACI\xd3N","YOUR SCORE:":"TU PUNTUACI\xd3N:","YOUR TURN":"TU TURNO",Yes:"S\xed","Yes, sign me up for news and updates from Skillz":"S\xed, deseo inscribirme para recibir noticias y actualizaciones de Skillz","You May Only Select One":"Solo puedes seleccionar uno","You Placed {0}":"Has quedado {0}","You Tied":"Has Empatado","You are **{0} Tier** until **{1}**.":"Est\xe1s en el **nivel {0}** hasta el **{1}**.","You are already friends with this player.":"Ya son amigos con este jugador.","You are already playing in a tournament with this group of players. Please check your Play tab":"Ya est\xe1s jugando en un torneo con este grupo de jugadores. Comprueba tu pesta\xf1a de Juego.","You are already registered for a different tournament. Please complete or cancel that match before entering another.":"Ya se registr\xf3 para un torneo distinto. Complete o cancele la partida antes de ingresar a otra.","You are not authorized to acccess contact data.":"Usted no est\xe1 autorizado para acceder a los datos del contacto.","You are now using {0} per entry.":"Ahora est\xe1s usando {0} por entrada.","You are ready to enter":"Ya est\xe1s listo para entrar","You are ready to explore the tutorial until your event starts":"Est\xe1s listo para explorar el tutorial hasta que comience tu evento","You are registered.":"Est\xe1s registrado.","You can also add friends directly from your address book.":"Tambi\xe9n puedes agregar amigos directamente desde tu libreta de direcciones.","You can also view your Ticketz details information by tapping your \"My Ticketz\".":"Tambi\xe9n puedes ver la informaci\xf3n sobre tus detalles de Ticketz si presionas \"Mis Ticketz\"","You can always view your Ticketz tier information by tapping \"My Tier\".":"Tambi\xe9n puedes ver la informaci\xf3n sobre tus niveles de Ticketz si presionas \"Mis niveles\"","You can notify a user by adding @ in front of their username":"\xbfPuedes notificar a un usuario al agregar @ delante de su nombre de usuario","You don't have enough funds to enter this match.":"No tiene fondos suficientes para ingresar a este juego.","You doubled your {0} winnings":"Has doblado tus ganancias de {0}","You earned {0}{1} back":"Ganaste {0}{1}","You have been banned from Chat":"Tienes prohibido entrar al Chat","You have been muted":"Te han silenciado","You have been muted.":"Te han silenciado.","You have blocked this player. Please unblock them before sending them a friend request.":"Usted bloque\xf3 a este jugador. Desbloqu\xe9elo antes de enviarle una solicitud de amistad.","You have completed your first deposit.\\nEnter your email address and a password\\nto save your account.":"Usted hizo su primer dep\xf3sito.\\nIngrese su direcci\xf3n de correo electr\xf3nico y una contrase\xf1a\\npara guardar su cuenta.","You have completed your first purchase. Enter your email address and a password to save your account.":"Ya completaste tu primera compra. Ingresa tu direcci\xf3n de correo electr\xf3nico y una contrase\xf1a para guardar tu cuenta.","You have earned `{0}` Ticketz in **{1}**.":"Has ganado `{0}` Ticketz en **{1}**.","You have exceeded your PayPal withdrawal limit. You may withdraw via Check.":"Has superado el l\xedmite de tu cuenta de PayPal. Puedes realizar el reintegro mediante cheque.","You have no existing conversations":"No tiene conversaciones existentes","You have reached the limit of {0} blocked players.":"Usted lleg\xf3 al l\xedmite de {0} jugadores bloqueados.","You have reached the limit of {0} friends.":"Usted lleg\xf3 al l\xedmite de {0} amigos.","You have reached the limit of {0} muted messages.":"Usted lleg\xf3 al l\xedmite de {0} mensajes silenciados.","You have reached the maximum number of entries for this tournament.":"Has alcanzado el n\xfamero m\xe1ximo de entradas para este torneo.","You may only change your username once":"Solo puedes cambiar tu nombre de usuario una vez","You may only have 5 emails at a time":"Solo puedes tener 5 correos electr\xf3nicos al mismo tiempo","You may only have 5 emails at a time.":"Solo puedes tener 5 correos electr\xf3nicos al mismo tiempo.","You may withdraw up to {0} using PayPal":"Puedes realizar un reintegro de hasta {0} mediante PayPal","You must add <b>{0}</b> as a Friend to play with them":"Debes a\xf1adir a <b>{0}</b> como amigo para jugar juntos","You must verify an email before withdrawing":"Debes verificar un correo electr\xf3nico antes de realizar un reintegro","You must verify your email address to perform this action. Please check your email and follow the instructions to complete the verification process":"Debes verificar tu direcci\xf3n de correo electr\xf3nico para realizar esta acci\xf3n. Revisa tu correo electr\xf3nico y sigue las instrucciones para completar el proceso de verificaci\xf3n.","You nudged {0}":"Has dado un toque a {0}","You placed 2nd and earned Ticketz!":"\xa1Has quedado 2.\xba y has ganado Ticketz!","You played against Skillz Staff":"Has jugado contra el equipo de Skillz","You tied! You can access the tie breaker game later from the Home Screen.":"Has empatado. Podr\xe1s acceder al juego de desempate m\xe1s tarde desde la pantalla de Inicio.","You will both be playing the same level.":"Ambos jugar\xe1 el mismo nivel.","You will not be registered until you tap 'Confirm Registration' on this page. Your entry fee/ticket will only be deducted then.":"No estar\xe1s inscrito hasta que presiones \"Confirmar inscripci\xf3n\" en esta p\xe1gina. En ese momento, se descontar\xe1 tu boleto o cuota de admisi\xf3n.","You will not receive alerts for muted conversations.":"Usted no recibir\xe1 alertas de conversaciones silenciadas.","You will not receive notifications for messages.":"No recibir\xe1s notifi