o. Intente de nuevo con las {2} restantes.","{0} one {1}":"{0} una {1}","{0} or Video":"{0} o Video","{0} to":"{0} a","{0} to stay {1}x":"{0} para permanecer {1}x","{0} to {1}x":"{0} a {1}x","{0}'S LEVELS":"NIVELES DE {0}","{0}'s Tournament":"Torneo de {0}","{0}'s event":"Evento de {0}","{0}+ PLAYERS":"{0}+ JUGADORES","{0}/{1}":"{0}/{1}","{0}/{1} Collected":"{0}/{1} acumulado","{0}d ":"{0} d ","{0}h":"{0} h","{0}h ":"{0} h ","{0}m":"{0} m","{0}m ":"{0} m ","{0}s":"{0} s","{0}x":"x{0}","{0}x Multiplier":"{0}x Multiplicador","{0}x Ticketz Multiplier":"{0}x Multiplicador de Ticketz","<p>Tap <b>\"Begin Match Now\"</b><p>":"<p>Pulse <b>\"Empezar la partida ahora\"</b><p>","Clicking \\\"Spectate\\\" will bring you to a live stream of the event in progress. You may want to open the link on another device so you can play and watch at the same time. \\n \\n":"Hacer clic en \\\"Observar\\\" te llevar\xe1 a una transmisi\xf3n en directo del evento en progreso. Es posible que desees abrir el v\xednculo en otro dispositivo para que puedas jugar y ver al mismo tiempo. \\n \\n","Don't Allow":"No permitir","It doesn't look like that worked. Please try again later.":"Parece que no funcion\xf3. Intente de nuevo m\xe1s tarde.","Let's Try Again!":"\xa1Intentemos de nuevo!","Let's start with a practice game against {0}!":"\xa1Empecemos con un juego de pr\xe1ctica contra {0}!","Let's start with a practice game! Once you are done you will be matched to an opponent who played the same level":"\xa1Comencemos con el juego de pr\xe1ctica! Una vez que termine se enfrentar\xe1 a un oponente que jug\xf3 en el mismo nivel","Looking for {0} friends?":"\xbfBuscando {0} amigos?","PROMO CODE":"C\xd3DIGO PROMOCIONAL","Play now, we're finding your opponent":"Juegue ahora, estamos buscando a su oponente","Promo Bonus Applied":"Bonificaci\xf3n de Promoci\xf3n Aplicada","Promo Code is Invalid":"El C\xf3digo de Promoci\xf3n es Inv\xe1lido","Skillz takes cheating very seriously. If you have any questions, you can always contact Skillz support in our \"Help and Support\" menu! Tap \"Next\" to play again!":"Skillz toma muy en serio las trampas. \xa1Si usted tiene alguna pregunta, siempre puede comunicarse con soporte de Skillz en nuestro men\xfa \"Ayuda y soporte\"! \xa1Pulse \"Siguiente\" para jugar de nuevo!","The more you play, the better we are at matching you against players of a similar skill level.  Tap \"Next\" to play again!":"Mientras m\xe1s juegue, ser\xe1 m\xe1s f\xe1cil que lo conectemos con jugadores de un nivel de habilidad similar.  \xa1Pulse \"Siguiente\" para jugar de nuevo!","To ensure fairness, you and your opponent will always play the same level in each match. Tap \"Next\" to play again!":"Para garantizar que el juego sea justo, usted y su oponente siempre jugar\xe1n en el mismo nivel en cada partida. \xa1Pulse \"Siguiente\" para jugar de nuevo!","View each player's score after each match":"Ver la puntuaci\xf3n de cada jugador despu\xe9s de cada partida","We're waiting for an opponent. Enable push notifications so we can alert you when your match is complete.":"Estamos esperando a un oponente. Activa el env\xedo de notificaciones para que podamos alertarte cuando la partida est\xe9 completa.","We're waiting for your opponent to accept the challenge. If push notifications are turned on, you'll receive a notification when the match is complete.":"Estamos esperando que tu oponente acepte el desaf\xedo. Si se activa el env\xedo de notificaciones, recibir\xe1s una notificaci\xf3n cuando termine la partida.","You have redeemed a {0}. You will receive a confirmation email shortly. Play on!":"Has canjeado: {0}. Recibir\xe1s un email de confirmaci\xf3n muy pronto. \xa1A jugar!","Your match history is summarized on the Home screen. Tap \"Play\" to find your next match!":"Tu historial de partidas se resume en la pantalla Inicio. \xa1Pulsa \"Jugar\" para buscar tu pr\xf3xima partida!",more:"m\xe1s",your:"tuyos","{0} Conversation?":"\xbfConversaci\xf3n {0}?","T